{
  "_comment": [
    "Sweep spec for ospool_stage.py (agent C's schema; sizing and grid from ospool/SIZING.md, agent D).",
    "One params row = one OSPool job = one complete ospool_evolve.py evolution.",
    "image: the container image file name (bump -vN whenever env.def changes).",
    "request: request_cpus / request_memory / request_disk (always with a unit). cpus also sets --workers",
    "  (ospool_evolve reads OMP_NUM_THREADS, which HTCondor sets to request_cpus).",
    "fixed: chunk_evolve flags passed to every job (null value = bare flag).",
    "columns: the per-row values, each passed as --<column> (underscores become hyphens); every row needs all.",
    "  hours = the job's wall budget (ospool_evolve: deadline = start + hours - 5 min); seed = the search seed.",
    "smoke / full: a list of rows {tag, <columns>}, or one generator {tag: format string, column: scalar |",
    "  list of values | {from, to} integer range}; the generator makes the product of the list/range columns.",
    "full: 9 settings, one knob changed from 'base' each; replicate sNN uses search seed NN in every setting",
    "  (so spot-check seeds are paired across settings). 80 jobs x 4 cpus x 6 h = 1920 core-hours.",
    "Tags: letters, digits, _ and -; unique across smoke and full (they name the result tarballs)."
  ],
  "image": "softbody-py313-v1.sif",
